!deck: Math Identities (Cloze)
!tags: Math Trigonometric Hyperbolic Identity
!type: Cloze Math

!id: zvAyOSCTQW
!text:
\[
{{c2::e^{ix}::\ldots}}
=
{{c1::\cos x + i \sin x::\ldots}}
\]

Euler's Formula
~~~

!id: Rjr9k6j6ba
!text:
\[
{{c2::e^{-ix}::\ldots}}
=
{{c1::\cos x - i \sin x::\ldots}}
\]

Euler's Formula
~~~

!id: inJ6BD8ofs
!text:
\[
{{c2::\left( \cos(x) + i \sin(x) \right)^n::\ldots}}
=
{{c1::\cos(nx) + i \sin(nx)::\ldots}}
\]

De Moivre's Formula
~~~

!id: kYCiPlxK4A
!text:
\[
{{c2::\left( \cosh(x) + i \sinh(x) \right)^n::\ldots}}
=
{{c1::\cosh(nx) + i \sinh(nx)::\ldots}}
\]

De Moivre's Formula
~~~
